     "description": "Postman collection to test health endpoints and webhooks\n\nAuthentication note: OneDrive integration uses server-side OAuth2 app-only (client credentials). No Authorization header is required from Postman - the server handles tokens. For local testing you may set ONEDRIVE_AUTH_MODE=test and provide MS_ACCESS_TOKEN in your environment. Note: OneDrive endpoints use server-side OAuth app-only; authentication is handled server-side."
